WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:03.175
- I started to feel like,
maybe they're transphobic.

00:00:03.175 --> 00:00:04.567
- Or maybe they're closeted trans.

00:00:04.567 --> 00:00:06.245
- You know what, I feel
like that's a thing.

00:00:06.245 --> 00:00:08.700
- It is a thing, it is totally a thing.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.283
(mellow music)

00:00:12.754 --> 00:00:13.799
Hi, my name is Christina.

00:00:13.799 --> 00:00:18.115
- Hi, I'm Skylar, and my
preferred pronouns are he and him.

00:00:18.115 --> 00:00:20.006
- And my pronouns are she and her.

00:00:20.006 --> 00:00:22.438
(mellow music)

00:00:22.438 --> 00:00:25.280
- I was like mom, I know you
think I'm gay, but I'm not.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.198
She didn't like, fully understand.

00:00:27.198 --> 00:00:29.719
And then she did her own research on it.

00:00:29.719 --> 00:00:31.933
She became more accepting of it.

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:33.984
It was better for me because
it made my life easier and

00:00:33.984 --> 00:00:38.307
happier as a person to know
that my mom was okay with it,

00:00:38.307 --> 00:00:40.699
cause my mom means like everything to me.

00:00:40.699 --> 00:00:42.981
- I was physically and verbally assaulted,

00:00:42.981 --> 00:00:45.776
I just had people like
scream awful things at me

00:00:45.776 --> 00:00:47.805
while I was walking through the hallway.

00:00:47.805 --> 00:00:50.448
But I think, once I was in seventh grade,

00:00:50.448 --> 00:00:52.603
it honestly wasn't as
bad, it's just, you know,

00:00:52.603 --> 00:00:54.846
sixth grade is such a hard
year anyway for everyone,

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:56.634
and especially when you're
trans and you're trying

00:00:56.634 --> 00:00:58.988
to deal with all of these
things and trying to just deal

00:00:58.988 --> 00:01:01.776
with junior high school in
general, it it so stressful.

00:01:01.776 --> 00:01:03.980
(upbeat music)

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.623
A big part of me is being trans, and like,

00:01:06.623 --> 00:01:09.799
if that means that that person
isn't going to be friends

00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:11.956
with me then so be it, because honestly,

00:01:11.956 --> 00:01:15.898
I'd rather that people know that I'm trans

00:01:15.898 --> 00:01:17.799
and not be friends with me,

00:01:17.799 --> 00:01:20.766
than someone not know that I'm
trans and be friends with me

00:01:20.766 --> 00:01:23.813
for so long and not know
this huge part of my identity

00:01:23.813 --> 00:01:25.545
that I'm so proud of.

00:01:25.545 --> 00:01:29.619
- After I transitioned, my
friends were so supportive of me.

00:01:29.619 --> 00:01:31.643
Yeah, they don't bring
up that I am transgender,

00:01:31.643 --> 00:01:33.583
they don't bring it up at
all, because it's like,

00:01:33.583 --> 00:01:34.934
what is there to bring up?

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.797
(upbeat music)

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.403
Yeah, so I didn't wanna
go to the girls restroom,

00:01:39.403 --> 00:01:41.228
and then I couldn't go
to the boys restroom,

00:01:41.228 --> 00:01:42.633
because everyone just looked at me.

00:01:42.633 --> 00:01:45.403
I would actually like,
take my time and walk

00:01:45.403 --> 00:01:48.516
across the campus to go
use the port-a-potties.

00:01:48.516 --> 00:01:53.320
The fact that I actually
wanted to go to a port-a-potty

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.279
instead of a bathroom that was marked--

00:01:55.279 --> 00:01:56.357
- That's really sad.

00:01:56.357 --> 00:01:58.674
- It's sad because they're not clean.

00:01:58.674 --> 00:02:01.978
- It's just so awful that
like, trans people are made out

00:02:01.978 --> 00:02:04.900
to almost be like, if we're
predators or something,

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.596
like going into the bathroom
to do something to someone,

00:02:07.596 --> 00:02:10.322
you know, I feel like people
should just able to use

00:02:10.322 --> 00:02:11.906
whatever bathroom they wanna use, I mean,

00:02:11.906 --> 00:02:13.544
it's a bathroom, you know?

00:02:13.544 --> 00:02:15.375
(upbeat music)

00:02:15.375 --> 00:02:17.482
- A teacher that I really
remember in my high school,

00:02:17.482 --> 00:02:19.710
her name is Miss Marquez.

00:02:19.710 --> 00:02:22.565
When all my classmates were
calling me by my other name,

00:02:22.565 --> 00:02:25.323
the one that I wanted, she
kinda took note of that,

00:02:25.323 --> 00:02:28.092
and she pulled me aside
one day, and she's like,

00:02:28.092 --> 00:02:31.163
so, you want me to call you Skylar?

00:02:31.163 --> 00:02:32.681
And I'm like, yes, please.

00:02:32.681 --> 00:02:34.237
And then she's like, do you want me to

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:35.452
call you by male pronouns?

00:02:35.452 --> 00:02:37.690
And I was like well, yes,
I would appreciate that.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:40.063
Out of all the teachers I
had, she really made me feel

00:02:40.063 --> 00:02:41.563
okay about myself.

00:02:42.816 --> 00:02:46.445
- You know, I've dealed
with awful counselors

00:02:46.445 --> 00:02:48.120
that weren't accepting, but, I mean,

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.429
I've also had really good experiences.

00:02:49.429 --> 00:02:51.643
My third grade teacher,
before I transitioned,

00:02:51.643 --> 00:02:53.462
has never messed my pronouns up,

00:02:53.462 --> 00:02:54.720
has never messed my name up,

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.153
I just wish that there were
more teachers like him,

00:02:57.153 --> 00:03:00.197
because honestly, I've just
not had the best teachers.

00:03:00.197 --> 00:03:02.224
(mellow music)

00:03:02.224 --> 00:03:03.915
If you're a trans person out there that is

00:03:03.915 --> 00:03:05.745
watching this video right now,

00:03:05.745 --> 00:03:07.620
I just want you know
that it's gonna be hard,

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.889
but it's so worth it in
the end when you are able

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:13.104
to be yourself and be able to
feel comfortable in your skin.

00:03:13.104 --> 00:03:14.961
(mellow music)

00:03:14.961 --> 00:03:16.817
We've been in your bathroom forever.

00:03:16.817 --> 00:03:18.203
- We've been there.

00:03:18.203 --> 00:03:19.822
I've seen the men's restroom,
it's not that clean.

00:03:19.822 --> 00:03:20.863
Girls restrooms are cleaner.

00:03:20.863 --> 00:03:21.696
(laughter)

00:03:21.696 --> 00:03:22.529
It's just true.

00:03:22.529 --> 00:03:23.362
(logo whooshes)

00:03:23.362 --> 00:03:24.761
(hinge squeaks)

